<title>USA: McGraw-Hill renames, realigns financial unit.</title>
<headline>McGraw-Hill renames, realigns financial unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>McGraw-Hill Cos Inc said on Thursday it will call its Financial Information Services Group Standard &amp; Poor's Financial Information Services.</p>
<p>McGraw-Hill Cos said the realigned group will comprise the Financial Services business together with Standard &amp; Poor's ratings.</p>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Financial Information will focus on the retail, institutional, corporate and municipal sectors, the company said.</p>
